/target

# Decrypted secrets (sops). Only the *.enc.env ciphertext is committed; tenx
# symlinks the plaintext sibling into place, and that link must never land in git.
secrets/*
!secrets/*.enc.env
.DS_Store

# The web page's dependencies and build output (make web); build.rs embeds web/out.
/web/node_modules
/web/.next
/web/out
/web/next-env.d.ts
/web/test-results
/web/playwright-report
/web/tsconfig.tsbuildinfo
